            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of Streptomyces sp. XY006, an Endophyte Isolated from Tea (Camellia sinensis).</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e00971-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.00971-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Streptomyces sp. XY006 is an endophytic bacterium isolated from the young leaf material of the tea plant (Camellia sinensis). The draft genome consists of 8.2 Mb and encodes 7,415 putative open reading frames. This strain is found to contain a high capacity for the production of natural products.</AbstractText>
